Hi,
there may be an issue with your function arguments.

detectionHistory(WorkbookR_Mil,camOp = WorkbookR_Mil, ...)

WorkbookR_Mil appears twice. This seems wrong.
First of all, it is good practice to explicitly name your arguments, as there is many of them. So write it as:

detectionHistory(recordTable = WorkbookR_Mil, camOp = ...)

Then, make sure your recordTable argument refers to the correct data frame. If you are not sure check or post the output of

str(WorkbookR_Mil)
colnames(WorkbookR_Mil)

Cheers,
Jürgen

